  "details": "I feel like there must be some better moderation when it comes to *censoring sensual / filtered content*\n\nI find it bad that as visitor to being able to unfilter this type of content, it makes the filter quite unused, and nobody would notice it so I want to change this:\n\n• Group owners. should be able to choose what RANKS/LEVELS of players that can join their group \n\nBasically making it so groups can get more moderated with what people that spent a certain time in the game can join those groups\n\nExemplar:\n\nGroup with “visitor” would allow players with visitor and up to join the group \n\nGroups with a higher rank, would require the user that rank or higher to be able to join it",
